  "independent_transcript": "They disputed whether measurements were kind. That was cleverer. If I answered with more figures, I appeared cold. If I answered with grief, I appeared unreliable. I should have published the method and let other observers repeat it. Instead, I waited for the office to ask a fair question. Waiting became a habit I could mistake for dignity.",
